                <pb facs="0870" n="836" xml:id="pg836"/>

                <head>349. Telegram From the Department of State to the
                        Mission in Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d349-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1967-08-29T00:10:00+00:00">August 29, 1967,
                        0010Z</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>28307. Deliver Callanan 9:00 a.m. August
                    29. Transmit following personal message from Solomon to Prebisch:</p>
                <p>“I intended telephone you last night but because lateness hour decided send you
                    this message instead. I am greatly concerned about reports I have received that
                    other members Consultative Group apparently regard US/Ghanaian
                        understanding<anchor n="2" xml:id="d349-f2"/> as basis for further
                    negotiation. It had been clear understanding that US/Ghanaian memorandum had
                    been accepted by African producers as basis for agreement and it was for this
                    reason that meeting Consultative Group scheduled. I need not remind you of
                    efforts made to reach agreement with Ghanaians on behalf African producers. I
                    hope you clearly aware that any significant departure from substance of
                    memorandum of understanding is outside the authorization I worked so hard to
                    get. Given the assurances that I gave in good faith on basis the understanding
                    with Ghana, it would make it impossible for me to recommend to my superiors
                    significant alterations.”</p>
                <p>At discretion Delegation give similar communication to Hackman.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#bold">Rusk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
